someone go especially in this position
where we had some money you know I

00:01:10.439 --> 00:01:13.979
wasn't sure if we could make the film
for that but it got to the point where I

00:01:13.979 --> 00:01:17.850
just had to go for it and and you know
that was at the point I decided to

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.100
produce it myself but the deadlines were
hard like we had a deadline we didn't

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:27.000
have a director I really wanted to phim
our director which is also proving hard

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.420
I think we've got a female director in
the November we were starting shooting

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:35.220
in the January February and I we got her
